# This image copies one directory, so exclude everything else: the context
# stays a few MB instead of the whole working tree, and nothing but the
# freshly built Storybook output can end up in the image.
#
# A dedicated ignore file (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore) rather
# than editing .dockerignore, which excludes /storybook-static for the sake of
# the frontend image and must keep doing so.
*
!storybook-static
